10.3 Create a Service that exposes the Deployment on the Kubernetes node network:
kubectl expose deployment nginx \
  --name=nginx \
  --port=80 \
  --target-port=80 \
  --type=NodePort

10.3 Retrieve the assigned NodePort:
kubectl get service nginx \
  -o jsonpath='{.spec.ports[0].nodePort}'

